<title>UK: Cheltenham &amp; Gloucester year pretax soars.</title>
<headline>Cheltenham &amp; Gloucester year pretax soars.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Trading surplus	    347.0		vs 301.9</p>
<p> Pretax			 335.8		vs 246.7</p>
<p> Bad/doubtful debt charge 11.2		 vs 43.7</p>
<p> Profit attributable	227.9		vs 167.0</p>
<p> Post tax return on equity 19.9 pct	  vs 17.5 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Cheltenham &amp; Gloucester, the UK building society, joined the Lloyds TSB Group Plc on August 1, 1995. Post tax return on equity relates to the period from August 1 to December 31 1995.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
